# warehouse

The warehouse gateway: a codefly/warehouse/v0 gRPC service in front of a SQL
warehouse. The backend is selected by configuration: the embedded engine
locally, a cloud warehouse when deployed.

A local run starts the published gateway image with a fresh shared secret and
hands it to consumers as the secret `token` value of the `warehouse`
configuration group. Set `backend` in service.codefly.yaml to choose the engine;
left unset, the gateway's own default applies. See
https://github.com/codefly-dev/service-warehouse for the backends that serve
queries today.
